            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I was able to repro. The crash seems to be in `Cython/Compiler/Optimize.py`: it assumes every arg with `is_starred` set is a `StarredUnpackingNode` with a `.target`, but starred names in assignment targets are plain nodes marked `is_starred` by `replace_starred_target_node()`.\n\nI have a fix ready. Happy to start a PR unless someone's already on it!\n",
